[{"answer":"Good morning everyone, and welcome to the Museum of Farming Life.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I understand it's your first visit here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/2.mp3"},{"answer":"so I'd like to give you some background information about the museum","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and then explain a little about what you can see during your visit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/4.mp3"},{"answer":"So, where we're standing at the moment is the entrance to a large building","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/5.mp3"},{"answer":"that was constructed in 1880","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/6.mp3"},{"answer":"as the home of a local businessman, Alfred Palmer, of the Palmer biscuit factory.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/7.mp3"},{"answer":"It was later sold and became a hall of residence for students in 1911,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/8.mp3"},{"answer":"and a museum in 1951.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/9.mp3"},{"answer":"In 2005, a modern extension was built to accommodate the museum's collections.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/10.mp3"},{"answer":"The museum's owned by the university,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and apart from two rooms that are our offices,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/12.mp3"},{"answer":"the university uses the main part of the building.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/13.mp3"},{"answer":"You may see students going into the building for lessons,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/14.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's not open to museum visitors, I'm afraid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/15.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a shame because the interior architectural features are outstanding,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/16.mp3"},{"answer":"especially the room that used to be the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Luckily, we've managed to keep entry to the museum free.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/18.mp3"},{"answer":"This includes access to all the galleries, outdoor areas and the rooms for special exhibitions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/19.mp3"},{"answer":"We run activities for children and students,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/20.mp3"},{"answer":"such as the museum club, for which there's no charge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/21.mp3"},{"answer":"We do have a donation box just over there","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/22.mp3"},{"answer":"so feel free to give whatever amount you consider appropriate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/23.mp3"},{"answer":"We do have a cloakroom,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/24.mp3"},{"answer":"if you'd like to leave your coats and bags somewhere.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Unlike other museums, photography is allowed here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/26.mp3"},{"answer":"so you might like to keep your cameras with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/27.mp3"},{"answer":"You might be more comfortable not carrying around heavy rucksacks,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/28.mp3"},{"answer":"though keep your coats and jackets on as it's quite cold in the museum garden today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to tell you about the different areas of the museum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Just inside, and outside the main gallery,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/31.mp3"},{"answer":"we have an area called Four Seasons.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Here you can watch a four-minute animation of a woodland scene.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/33.mp3"},{"answer":"It was designed especially for the museum","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/34.mp3"},{"answer":"by a group of young people on a film studies course, and it's beautiful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Children absolutely love it, but then, so do adults.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/36.mp3"},{"answer":"The main gallery's called Town and Country.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It includes a photographic collection of prize-winning sheep and shepherds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Leaving Town and Country, you enter Farmhouse Kitchen,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/39.mp3"},{"answer":"which is... well, self-explanatory.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Here we have the oldest collection of equipment for making butter and cheese in the country.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/41.mp3"},{"answer":"And this morning, a specialist cheesemaker will be giving demonstrations of how it's produced.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/42.mp3"},{"answer":"You may even get to try some.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/43.mp3"},{"answer":"After that, you can go in two directions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/44.mp3"},{"answer":"To the right is a staircase","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/45.mp3"},{"answer":"that takes you up to a landing from where you can look down on the galleries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/46.mp3"},{"answer":"To the left is a room called A Year on the Farm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/47.mp3"},{"answer":"There's lots of seating here as sometimes we use the room for school visits,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/48.mp3"},{"answer":"so it's a good place to stop for a rest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/49.mp3"},{"answer":"If you're feeling competitive,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/50.mp3"},{"answer":"you can take our memory test in which you answer questions about things you've seen in the museum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/51.mp3"},{"answer":"The next area's called Wagon Walk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/52.mp3"},{"answer":"This contains farm carts from nearly every part of the country.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/53.mp3"},{"answer":"It's surprising how much regional variation there was.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Beside the carts are display boards with information about each one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/55.mp3"},{"answer":"The carts are old and fragile,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/56.mp3"},{"answer":"so we ask you to keep your children close to you","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/57.mp3"},{"answer":"and ensure they don't climb on the carts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/58.mp3"},{"answer":"From Wagon Walk, you can either make your way back to reception","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/59.mp3"},{"answer":"or go out into the garden","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/60.mp3"},{"answer":"or even go back to take another look in the galleries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/61.mp3"},{"answer":"In the far corner of the garden is Bees are Magic,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/62.mp3"},{"answer":"but we're redeveloping this area so you can't visit that at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/63.mp3"},{"answer":"You can still buy our honey in the shop, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Finally, there's The Pond,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/65.mp3"},{"answer":"which contains all kinds of interesting wildlife.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/66.mp3"},{"answer":"There are baby ducks that are only a few days old, as well as tiny frogs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/67.mp3"},{"answer":"The Pond isn't deep and there's a fence around it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/68.mp3"},{"answer":"so it's perfectly safe for children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-2-2023-06-17-19-17-08/69.mp3"}]
